{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_01",
      "hash": "45c432aa3fa8d7dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：我说，那边的家伙！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_02",
      "hash": "45c435aa3fa8dcf5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：我说你啊，难不成就是\\n那个叫[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的家伙吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0170_select_01",
      "hash": "d0d9c0d403d03387",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真厉害！没错！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0170_select_02",
      "hash": "d0d9c1d403d0353a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你怎么知道！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_03",
      "hash": "45c434aa3fa8db42",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然是吧！\\n不愧是本大爷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_04",
      "hash": "45c42faa3fa8d2c3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "简直和爷爷跟我形容的样子\\n一模一样！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_05",
      "hash": "45c42eaa3fa8d110",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：我是青绿！\\c\\n因为听我那大木爷爷说，\\n真新镇又有跟我一样的\\r\\n训练家踏上了旅途，\\c\\n所以就想马上过来看个究竟！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_06",
      "hash": "45c431aa3fa8d629",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "本来还想由最强的我\\n来给你一些挑战道馆的建议呢，\\r\\n没想到你的战斗已经顺利结束了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_11",
      "hash": "45c0aeaa3fa5c1b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "看来你很有前途嘛！\\n这是给你的奖励！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0170_red_01",
      "hash": "cfe03f2037f8e3dc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_07",
      "hash": "45c430aa3fa8d476",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0170_red_02",
      "hash": "cfe0422037f8e8f5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 11]"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0170_dummy_01",
      "hash": "ad78127e34c878c1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从青绿那里\\n得到了５个[VAR COLOR(0006)]超级球[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_08",
      "hash": "45c43baa3fa8e727",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "青绿：超级球比普通的精灵球\\n更容易捉到宝可梦哦！\\c\\n……话说，那不是宝可梦图鉴吗？\\n爷爷终于研发成功了啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_09",
      "hash": "45c43aaa3fa8e574",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想当年我冒险的时候，可是用铅笔\\n在地图上记录分布状况的……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0170_green_10",
      "hash": "45c0adaa3fa5c006",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你要认真协助我大木爷爷啊！\\n那么再见了！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0170_max",
      "hash": "b5a50e9c59dc4e9f"
    }
  ]
}
